Package: flydigi-vader4d
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-evdev, udev
Description: Userspace DInput driver for Flydigi Vader 4 Pro
 Provides a uinput gamepad and a Unix control socket for the Flydigi
 Vader 4 Pro over USB / 2.4 GHz dongle (and Bluetooth DInput input).
 .
 Installs a user systemd unit (flydigi-vader4d.service) and udev rules.

Package: vader-companion
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-evdev, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets | python3-pyside6, flydigi-vader4d
Description: Vader Companion for Flydigi Vader 4 Pro
 Desktop app to configure lighting, feel, button maps, and firmware for
 the Flydigi Vader 4 Pro on Linux.
